[en.DECISION_WETM_BONDS_TO_CIV_FACTORY]
Light Industry Investment

[en.DECISION_WETM_BONDS_TO_CIV_FACTORY_desc]
Use $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ to pay for the cost of investing in light industry.

[zh.DECISION_WETM_BONDS_TO_CIV_FACTORY]
轻工业投资

[zh.DECISION_WETM_BONDS_TO_CIV_FACTORY_desc]
将 $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ 用于支付轻工业投资的成本。
